WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.870 --> 00:00:10.539
&gt;&gt; I'M RAYMOND ARROYO SITTING IN

00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:16.011
FOR LAURA INGRAHAM.

00:00:16.012 --> 00:00:17.813
WE SHOWED VIDEOS OF HOOLIGANS

00:00:17.814 --> 00:00:19.248
THROWING WATER AT NEW YORK CITY

00:00:19.249 --> 00:00:19.948
POLICE OFFICERS IN BROOKLYN.

00:00:19.949 --> 00:00:21.283
AND THEN ANOTHER ATTACK.

00:00:21.284 --> 00:00:23.418
SHOWING AN OFFICER MAKING AN

00:00:23.419 --> 00:00:25.387
ARREST IN HARLEM GETTING

00:00:25.388 --> 00:00:26.288
DRENCHED WITH WATER AND THEN HIT

00:00:26.289 --> 00:00:27.723
IN THE HEAD WITH A BUCKET.

00:00:27.724 --> 00:00:29.358
IN THE DAYS AND WEEKS TO FOLLOW,

00:00:29.359 --> 00:00:31.827
MORE VIDEOS OF PEOPLE

00:00:31.828 --> 00:00:32.728
DISRESPECTING POLICE HAVE

00:00:32.729 --> 00:00:33.095
SURFACED.

00:00:33.096 --> 00:00:35.964
THESE ATTACKS ARE ESCALATING.

00:00:35.965 --> 00:00:36.965
THE "NEW YORK POST" REPORTS.

00:00:36.966 --> 00:00:38.767
CHUNK OF CONCRETE, BOTTLES

00:00:38.768 --> 00:00:43.105
THROWN AT NYPD COPS IN SEPARATE

00:00:43.106 --> 00:00:43.505
INCIDENTS.

00:00:43.506 --> 00:00:45.741
ATTACKS LIKE THESE HAVE MOVED

00:00:45.742 --> 00:00:49.244
FROM NEW YORK STATE GOP TO

00:00:49.245 --> 00:00:51.313
LAWMAKERS TO PROPOSED

00:00:51.314 --> 00:00:53.715
LEGISLATION MAKING IT A FELONY

00:00:53.716 --> 00:00:55.584
TO DUMPING WATER ON COPS.

00:00:55.585 --> 00:00:57.052
SOME DEMOCRATS ARE TRYING TO

00:00:57.053 --> 00:00:59.521
STOP IT.

00:00:59.522 --> 00:01:07.963
JOINING ME IS BERNIE KERIK.

00:01:07.964 --> 00:01:10.065
&gt;&gt; WHAT THIS DOES, IT EMBOLDENS

00:01:10.066 --> 00:01:11.800
THESE GUYS THAT GO OUT AND DO

00:01:11.801 --> 00:01:13.602
THIS STUFF.

00:01:13.603 --> 00:01:16.505
THEY SEE IT ON VIDEO.

00:01:16.506 --> 00:01:17.539
THERE'S COPYCAT ATTACKS.

00:01:17.540 --> 00:01:21.610
WE'RE SEEING IT NOT ONLY IN NEW

00:01:21.611 --> 00:01:22.010
YORK CITY.

00:01:22.011 --> 00:01:23.312
IN NEW YORK CITY WE'VE SEEN A

00:01:23.313 --> 00:01:24.846
NUMBER OF THEM.

00:01:24.847 --> 00:01:26.048
THE NEW YORK CITY COPS HAVE LAID

00:01:26.049 --> 00:01:26.915
BACK.

00:01:26.916 --> 00:01:30.786
THEY'RE AFRAID OF THE MAYOR.

00:01:30.787 --> 00:01:31.954
THEY'RE CONCERNED THEY'LL NEVER

00:01:31.955 --> 00:01:33.355
BEEN SUPPORTED BY THE MAYOR.

00:01:33.356 --> 00:01:35.557
THE MAYOR SAID WE'RE GOING TO

00:01:35.558 --> 00:01:36.425
ARREST THEM.

00:01:36.426 --> 00:01:38.060
THEY'RE ARRESTING THEM AFTER THE

00:01:38.061 --> 00:01:39.828
FACT BECAUSE OF PUBLIC PRESSURE.

00:01:39.829 --> 00:01:41.697
THE COPS SHOULD NOT BE AFRAID TO

00:01:41.698 --> 00:01:43.999
DO THEIR JOB BECAUSE WE HAVE A

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:44.433
WEAK MAYOR.

00:01:44.434 --> 00:01:45.767
&gt;&gt; Raymond: AND DO IT IN THE

00:01:45.768 --> 00:01:46.101
MOMENT.

00:01:46.102 --> 00:01:46.868
&gt;&gt; YEAH.

00:01:46.869 --> 00:01:49.004
THERE'S PLENTY OF CHARGES,

00:01:49.005 --> 00:01:52.140
WHETHER IT'S CRIMINAL MISCHIEF,

00:01:52.141 --> 00:01:55.077
DISORDERLY CONDUCT, HARASSMENT,

00:01:55.078 --> 00:01:55.410
ASSAULT.

00:01:55.411 --> 00:01:57.045
PLENTY OF CHARGES THESE PEOPLE

00:01:57.046 --> 00:01:59.147
COULD HAVE BEEN CHARGED WITH BUT

00:01:59.148 --> 00:01:59.781
WERE NOT.

00:01:59.782 --> 00:02:01.650
I SEE COPS THAT ARE AFRAID TO DO

00:02:01.651 --> 00:02:03.085
THEIR JOB BECAUSE OF THE MAYOR

00:02:03.086 --> 00:02:06.955
THAT IS AN ANTI COP MAYOR.

00:02:06.956 --> 00:02:09.124
&gt;&gt; Raymond: SEAN HANNITY ASKED

00:02:09.125 --> 00:02:09.992
de BLASIO ABOUT THIS.

00:02:09.993 --> 00:02:10.993
WE'LL PLAY THE CLIP.

00:02:10.994 --> 00:02:11.293
WATCH.

00:02:11.294 --> 00:02:14.029
&gt;&gt; HERE'S MY QUESTION FOR YOU.

00:02:14.030 --> 00:02:16.298
EVERY PERSON ON VIDEO THAT HAS

00:02:16.299 --> 00:02:18.834
COMMITTED A CRIME -- EVERY --

00:02:18.835 --> 00:02:20.669
&gt;&gt; LOOK AT THAT GUY.

00:02:20.670 --> 00:02:22.537
&gt;&gt; YOU SEE WHAT HE JUST DID?

00:02:22.538 --> 00:02:24.373
&gt;&gt; THIS IS INCREDIBLE.

00:02:24.374 --> 00:02:29.111
&gt;&gt; THAT'S NOT A GOOD ENOUGH

00:02:29.112 --> 00:02:29.878
STATEMENT.

00:02:29.879 --> 00:02:31.146
EVERYBODY THAT COMMIT AS CRIME

00:02:31.147 --> 00:02:32.347
WILL BE BROUGHT TO JUSTICE.

00:02:32.348 --> 00:02:34.983
&gt;&gt; OUR POLICE OFFICERS KNOW WHO

00:02:34.984 --> 00:02:36.385
COMMITS A CRIME AND THEY WILL

00:02:36.386 --> 00:02:37.252
BRING THEM --

00:02:37.253 --> 00:02:38.053
&gt;&gt; Raymond: WHAT KIND OF

00:02:38.054 --> 00:02:39.788
MESSAGE --

00:02:39.789 --> 00:02:43.959
&gt;&gt; YOU'RE LOOKING AT A GUY THAT

00:02:43.960 --> 00:02:45.560
