00:02:49.732 --> 00:02:51.900
WATCH OUT FOR THE MEN AND WOMEN

00:02:51.901 --> 00:02:52.968
IN THE NEW YORK CITY POLICE

00:02:52.969 --> 00:02:53.402
DEPARTMENT.

00:02:53.403 --> 00:02:54.936
DON'T GIVE ME THIS GARBAGE NOW

00:02:54.937 --> 00:02:56.138
EVERYBODY WILL BE ARRESTED.

00:02:56.139 --> 00:02:59.141
THAT'S NOT THE MENTALITY OF THIS

00:02:59.142 --> 00:03:00.909
MAYOR.

00:03:00.910 --> 00:03:02.778
THIS MAYOR VILLAINIZES THE COPS.

00:03:02.779 --> 00:03:05.480
HE'S DONE IT CONSISTENTLY.

00:03:05.481 --> 00:03:06.915
THE MEN AND THE WOMEN IN NEW

00:03:06.916 --> 00:03:07.716
YORK CITY KNOW IT.

00:03:07.717 --> 00:03:09.117
&gt;&gt; THIS IS GOVERNOR ANDREW

00:03:09.118 --> 00:03:09.484
CUOMO.

00:03:09.485 --> 00:03:10.986
